OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSASorrow of the children shipped to
OL,4,ACanada all alone
OL,5,
OL,6,FThese children were separated from
OL,7,Ftheir families and sent off to Canada
OL,8,Fas a source of cheap labour, often
OL,9,Fsuffering mistreatment at the hands of
OL,10,Fthose who took them in, said Rose's
OL,11,Fgreat grandson Malcolm Farrow.
OL,13,FFarrow said Fred was sent to
OL,14,FSaskatchewan first and then Rose asked
OL,15,Fto be sent over when she was 17,
OL,16,Fthinking they would be reunited.
